  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK&#x2019;s contribution to the EU Turkey Refugee Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity The UK&#x2019;s contribution to the EU Turkey Refugee Facility  is a component of The UK&#x2019;s contribution to the Facility for Refugees in Turkey.  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;275,692,399. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management, Health policy and administrative management, Material relief assistance and services, Food assistance, Relief co-ordination and support services, Urban development and management.</narrative>
  </description>
